# STRUM on KEYS: a chord recorded on the tape keeps its notes apart (the strum survives the take and QUANT)
wait 300
tap SAVE
wait 100
tapkey w4
wait 200
press HOME
tapkey b0
release HOME
tap LFO
tap LFO
wait 50
turn K4 30
wait 50
tap REC
wait 4100
key w4 down 100
wait 800
key w4 up
wait 2000
tap REC
wait 200
tap PLAY
expect events 4
expect evpos >0
expect evlast >10
